# Domain Seed Data Design (OpenSPDD REASONS Canvas)

## R — Requirements

See [`spec.md`](./spec.md) Purpose, Current state, Outcomes, Requirements. v3 — see that file's change control for what changed.

This document is the **execution plan for the Spring Boot side** — Haystack does not own the `heavy_rental` schema or its seed mechanism, only the requirements the data must satisfy.

## E — Entities

| Concept | Role |
|---------|------|
| `AssetCategory` | 4 fixed rows, names unchanged |
| `Asset` | Fleet unit — 27 total (19 new + 8 existing, no existing values changed beyond the 6 `NULL` capacity backfills) |
| `AssetImage` | One row per new asset (19), reusing an existing same-brand sibling's base64 content — no new photo files |
